 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The weather in GTA 6 felt stuck, and Rockstar's first patch just backed up the players who said so."
  },
  {
   "text": "It's update 01.002.002, out November twenty-third."
  },
  {
   "text": "The notes say Rockstar fixed weather that did not change for extended periods."
  },
  {
   "text": "So endless sunshine, or a storm that never ends, should finally cycle."
  },
  {
   "text": "The patch also fixes crashes, autosave, and a wanted level you could not lose."
  },
  {
   "text": "On PS5 it's only about six hundred megabytes."
  },
  {
   "text": "Some players still report crashes, though, so it's just the first patch."
  },
  {
   "text": "It shows Rockstar is listening, so tell us below, did you also notice that"
  }
